---
// Section 03: Esperienze Professionali (Figma 17:6808 / 83:252 - Match Image 2)
import SectionPatternCanvas from "./SectionPatternCanvas.astro"
---

<section
  id="section-03"
  class="section-slide relative w-screen min-w-[100vw] h-full overflow-y-auto px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 flex flex-col justify-start shrink-0 snap-start pt-24 sm:pt-28 pb-8"
>
  <SectionPatternCanvas theme="code" />
  <div class="w-full max-w-[1312px] mx-auto flex flex-col justify-start gap-6 relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Editorial Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 pb-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-[6px] bg-[#FDF2F4] dark:bg-[#380A10] border border-[#FECDD3] dark:border-red-900 text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-300 font-bold text-[11px] tracking-wide font-mono">
          03 // DOVE HO LAVORATO?
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[32px] font-bold text-[#0F172A] dark:text-white tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1 m-0">
        Esperienze Lavorative &amp; Percorso Professionale
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#64748B] dark:text-gray-300 max-w-4xl m-0 leading-normal">
        Le collaborazioni e esperienze professionali fino ad oggi
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Experience Cards Grid (2x2 Grid) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- Card 1: Skill Factory -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-[12px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-2xs">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 pb-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] bg-[#FFF1F2] dark:bg-red-950/40 border border-[#FECDD3] dark:border-red-900/60 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[13px] text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-300 shrink-0">
                SK
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-[15px] text-[#0F172A] dark:text-white m-0">
                  Skill Factory
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-[#64748B] dark:text-gray-400 m-0">
                  Back-end Developer
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 font-sans text-[11px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 whitespace-nowrap">
              Somministrazione
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[11.5px] font-mono text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-400 mt-2.5 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <span>2025 - Presente (Luglio 2026)</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-[12px] text-[#475569] dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Insegnamento pratico di Unity e programmazione orientata agli oggetti (OOP) in linguaggio C#.</li>
            <li>Sviluppo piattaforma web aziendale focalizzato sul Back-end tramite Java / Spring Boot + Thymeleaf.</li>
            <li>Monitoraggio continuo di progetti studenteschi, supporto tecnico e sessioni di code review.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Unity</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">C#</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Java</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Spring Boot</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Thymeleaf</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Didattica</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">OOP</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: L'ABCD Edutainment -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-[12px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-2xs">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 pb-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] bg-[#FFF1F2] dark:bg-red-950/40 border border-[#FECDD3] dark:border-red-900/60 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[13px] text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-300 shrink-0">
                L'
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-[15px] text-[#0F172A] dark:text-white m-0">
                  L'ABCD Edutainment
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-[#64748B] dark:text-gray-400 m-0">
                  Unity (C#) Developer HMI-MR
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 font-sans text-[11px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 whitespace-nowrap">
              Tirocinio Extracurriculare
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[11.5px] font-mono text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-400 mt-2.5 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <span>2024 - 2025 (Gennaio - Aprile 2026)</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-[12px] text-[#475569] dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Collaborazione alla ricerca e sviluppo di progetti orientati alla didattica per la piattaforma MR zSpace e...</li>
            <li>Sviluppo in C# dei sistemi e wrapper multi SDK per l Interazione spaziale 3D.</li>
            <li>Concept grafico (Figma-Canva) e implementazione UI &amp; UX interattiva tramite uGUI.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Mixed Reality</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">zSpace</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Multi SDK</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">C#</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">uGUI</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">MR-HMI</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">R&amp;D</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Protom Group -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-[12px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-2xs">
        <div>
