              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-[15px] text-[#0F172A] dark:text-white m-0">
                  Protom Group
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-[#64748B] dark:text-gray-400 m-0">
                  Front-end Developer
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 font-sans text-[11px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 whitespace-nowrap">
              Somministrazione
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[11.5px] font-mono text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-400 mt-2.5 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <span>2023 - 2024 (Novembre 2025)</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-[12px] text-[#475569] dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Co-sviluppo piattaforma web focalizzato sul Front-end tramite HTML5, CSS3 e JavaScript.</li>
            <li>Prototipazione e programmazione moduli interattivi Unity &amp; XR per clienti enterprise.</li>
            <li>Integrazione pipeline asset grafici e ottimizzazione del rendering real-time.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Front-end</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">HTML5</span>
