            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 font-sans text-[11px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 whitespace-nowrap">
              Tirocinio Curriculare
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[11.5px] font-mono text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-400 mt-2.5 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <span>Nov 2024 - Apr 2025</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-[12px] text-[#475569] dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Durante i 5 mesi di stage (oltre 720 ore) ho collaborato attivamente allo sviluppo di due prodotti B2B rea...</li>
            <li>Architettura software in C#, integrazione UI (uGUI), gestione localizzazione e Custom Editor Tools per o...</li>
            <li>Testing, profilazione performance e packaging build WebGL cross-browser.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Unity</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">C#</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">WebGL</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">B2B Solutions</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Custom Editor Tools</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">Localization</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans text-[11px]">720+ Ore</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
